  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 602.24 Point of contact (POC)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 602.24 “Point of contact (POC)” means a person designated by a group of responsible parties to file reports and receive notices on behalf of all of the responsible parties.\n\nSource. #10831, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14159, eff 12-25-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or600.html"
